[{"title":"邵少湄折柬有楼台将送暑凉露报新秋之句用何诗飘洒欣然余怀走笔答之 其二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"楼台将送暑，关塞已迎秋。\n纨扇感无极，金兰气欲浮。\n何时携好伴，樵月共清讴。\n踏断四峰路，浑忘世外忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12992,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邵少湄折柬有楼台将送暑凉露报新秋之句用何诗飘洒欣然余怀走笔答之 其三","author":"霍与瑕","text":"楼台将送暑，关塞已迎秋。\n月色天街近，风香水阁浮。\n花开莲子唱，风引竹枝讴。\n此夕正七夕，能来同写忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12993,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楼台送暑之句再三歌讽浑欲伤秋再用韵纪兴 其一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"楼台将送暑，江海欲涵秋。\n目断孤帆迥，神伤远霭浮。\n白驹怜古调，鸿雁起新讴。\n百粤升平日，谁先倾否忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12994,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楼台送暑之句再三歌讽浑欲伤秋再用韵纪兴 其二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"楼台将送暑，零露已飘秋。\n绿树流芳润，横塘积翠浮。\n旧传双鲤信，谁唱跃鱼讴。\n泳藻熙然在，人间空百忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12995,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楼台送暑之句再三歌讽浑欲伤秋再用韵纪兴 其三","author":"霍与瑕","text":"楼台将送暑，风日正争秋。\n大火宵犹午，微凉朝渐浮。\n红莲新度曲，乌桕旧传讴。\n忽忆天涯路，鹡鸰生远忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12996,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楼台送暑之句再三歌讽浑欲伤秋再用韵纪兴 其四","author":"霍与瑕","text":"楼台将送暑，花草半含秋。\n三径绿云合，一天清露浮。\n星河空有恨，月殿是谁讴。\n牛女年年隔，不知曾颇忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12997,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵奉答郭西桥 其一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"元冬已改仲，黄菊尚檠秋。\n乱蕊霜浑薄，繁枝露欲浮。\n谁将楚水调，共续南山讴。\n插鬓兼盈把，悠然忘世忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12998,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵奉答郭西桥 其二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"元冬已改仲，丹树故凝秋。\n暖日千林静，寒烟一抹浮。\n赤藤来旧伴，斑竹转新讴。\n细细清声度，孤栖消远忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12999,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵奉答郭西桥 其三","author":"霍与瑕","text":"元冬已改仲，皇历又颁秋。\n天子万年圣，日华五彩浮。\n六旬回甲子，四海共歌讴。\n世世龙光普，文王何所忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13000,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵奉答郭西桥 其四","author":"霍与瑕","text":"元冬已改仲，碧水旧涵秋。\n雁阵声何急，鱼书寂不浮。\n天涯穷短目，泽畔苦长讴。\n叹息美人远，寒山殷百忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13001,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和古林何先生闻报之作 其一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"独乐丘园久，重明委照来。\n拔茅连茹起，举鼎待铉回。\n善世谦谦德，康侯井井才。\n愿公飞翰入，巽命急需裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13002,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和古林何先生闻报之作 其二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"饯别天衢上，需郊酒未深。\n同人离索意，观国壮行心。\n道长三阳泰，几先八月临。\n孚号还惕厉，由豫羡朋簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13003,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和古林何先生闻报之作 其三","author":"霍与瑕","text":"牵复趋三殿，含章侍五云。\n黄裳方下士，朱绂正宜君。\n鸣鹤縻新爵，潜龙离旧群。\n窥观吾窃喜，豹变蔚同文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13004,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和古林何先生闻报之作 其四","author":"霍与瑕","text":"来章知庆旧，视履见祥新。\n锡马期康国，包鱼肯远民。\n敦临孚惠德，显比乐同仁。\n独恨逵鸿者，金兰失所亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13005,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藕花亭杂咏为梁浮山中书 其一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"桥临杨柳畔，亭在藕花间。\n曲槛开三面，疏帘绕四阑。\n青萍鱼在在，绿树鸟关关。\n朋旧追欢赏，应无一日閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13006,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藕花亭杂咏为梁浮山中书 其二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"翠盖低时雨，红妆烂晚霞。\n乱香飘淡荡，一色拥清华。\n境胜当人意，林幽得自誇。\n蕊珠天界是，何处问仙家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13007,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藕花亭杂咏为梁浮山中书 其三","author":"霍与瑕","text":"幽栖真胜地，清爽逼秋天。\n密叶应藏鬼，高花或坐仙。\n君当容借宿，吾欲驻经年。\n饮露飧英足，莲房受一廛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13008,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藕花亭杂咏为梁浮山中书 其四","author":"霍与瑕","text":"一瓣可游仙，花潭到九天。\n歌声微远岸，棹影入轻烟。\n举袂招那得，凌波去可怜。\n坐令同赏伴，怅望五云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13009,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藕花亭杂咏为梁浮山中书 其五","author":"霍与瑕","text":"莫唱采莲歌，采莲伤叶多。\n叶伤犹自可，花伤将奈何。\n借露匀红粉，因风舞绿罗。\n凭阑仍对酒，幽兴任清波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13010,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藕花亭杂咏为梁浮山中书 其六","author":"霍与瑕","text":"莫泛采莲舟，绿江生远愁。\n歌声偏袅袅，苦恨故悠悠。\n音信千山断，馨香一握稠。\n美人何处所，明日又三秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13011,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藕花亭杂咏为梁浮山中书 其七","author":"霍与瑕","text":"绮席花间列，歌舟叶底穿。\n清秋翻妙曲，白雪赋新篇。\n旧赏浑无厌，兹来更有缘。\n不知今夜月，犹得照潺湲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13012,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藕花亭杂咏为梁浮山中书 其八","author":"霍与瑕","text":"水镜彻层霄，渔舠泛阔寥。\n避花收短棹，按节度长箫。\n越唱翻淘浪，吴讴杂采樵。\n主人能饮客，拚不睡今宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13013,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藕花亭杂咏为梁浮山中书 其九","author":"霍与瑕","text":"风雨蛟精出，搴帘湿奕棋。\n三秋纷赴节，六月乱添衣。\n酒酌频踰醒，笙歌爽更徽。\n晚晴还有月，今夜不须归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13014,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藕花亭杂咏为梁浮山中书 其十","author":"霍与瑕","text":"待月藕花亭，衣冠集穗城。\n天香飘渐细，国色影弥清。\n鹤发欣陪侍，犀觞得屡擎。\n独惭才思短，授简赋难成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13015,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藕花亭杂咏为梁浮山中书 其十一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"雨洗重重暑，风传阵阵香。\n是谁歌白纻，有客赋青湘。\n酒宽知己量，醉觉过人狂。\n公自怜才者，寥天恕阮康。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13016,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藕花亭杂咏为梁浮山中书 其十二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"高兴逢贤主，杯盘晚未收。\n白华歌进酒，明月坐邀秋。\n得食驯坭鲋，忘机狎野鸥。\n汪汪千顷度，不忝旧风流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13017,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盍簪楼杂咏十首 其一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"小搆临幽僻，衡门昼亦关。\n朱帘垂绿水，华槛倚青山。\n粤秀屏长护，天香花自閒。\n高人时枉顾，清论散琅珊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13018,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盍簪楼杂咏十首 其二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"草创荒芜甚，群仙每每过。\n短墙侵碧蔓，细路合青莎。\n笔落惊人赋，杯深放客歌。\n会须倾倒尽，岂得但微酡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13019,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盍簪楼杂咏十首 其三","author":"霍与瑕","text":"春游芳沼阔，缓步大堤平。\n细雨滋园芷，微风荡野萍。\n逍遥来九老，笑语引诸生。\n更荷留雄藻，光辉藉盛名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13020,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盍簪楼杂咏十首 其四","author":"霍与瑕","text":"三径足幽栖，高贤况有题。\n青霄榕翠合，朱夏荔丹齐。\n骤雨穿渠急，狂风压竹低。\n稍晴僮发笱，喜得满筐携。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13021,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盍簪楼杂咏十首 其五","author":"霍与瑕","text":"小坐青楼下，微凉次第添。\n池鱼纷咂藻，山鸟静窥檐。\n鹤节排阴密，龙须带润纤。\n谁云六月暑，风紧欲拖帘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13022,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盍簪楼杂咏十首 其六","author":"霍与瑕","text":"真率风流在，存羊意可寻。\n约宾无速简，会长有严箴。\n茗煮他山嫩，花分别院阴。\n自然幽赏足，谁道剡溪深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13023,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盍簪楼杂咏十首 其七","author":"霍与瑕","text":"上上盍簪楼，遥天一望收。\n日移南陆晷，风送海门秋。\n五岭紫霞幛，三山杜若洲。\n看看星河近，乘槎好溯流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13024,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盍簪楼杂咏十首 其八","author":"霍与瑕","text":"山鬼催狂雨，雷师送骤凉。\n菊花新夹路，竹叶故盈觞。\n亲旧疏仪貌，笑谈杂谑浪。\n夜来临水酌，烟月淡微霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13025,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盍簪楼杂咏十首 其九","author":"霍与瑕","text":"有客来何暮，芳尊日欲斜。\n馔分青竹笋，茗泛绿葱花。\n方外参玄契，时中订作家。\n三更山月起，更与玩清华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13026,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盍簪楼杂咏十首 其十","author":"霍与瑕","text":"鹤发朱颜老，何当驾屡过。\n秋衫绵葛杂，时果柿蕉多。\n携盒情何限，投壶酒每酡。\n别来空怅望，林麓故阿那。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13027,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"行路说艰难，江西十八滩。\n乱流森铁石，急濑泻琼珊。\n浪搏心同碎，风低意颇安。\n觉来人世险，不在此中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13028,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"扁舟下若驰，石罅度高危。\n犀角倒囷出，龙牙断阵欹。\n仙宫洵有美，水府旧多奇。\n愿借狂澜砥，中原柱地维。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13029,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其三","author":"霍与瑕","text":"呼沱冰始合，铁马乱中流。\n剑盾参差渡，旌旗次第游。\n隐现六龙驾，仪刑五凤楼。\n君王奠八极，鳌足此灵邱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13030,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其四","author":"霍与瑕","text":"东海分龙种，来游第几遭。\n戈旗三百里，鳞甲一秋毫。\n日短川原寂，天寒水石高。\n白鸥如有约，雪羽振清皋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13031,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其五","author":"霍与瑕","text":"山驿开攸镇，水程说俗淳。\n四围千嶂合，中汇一源春。\n打鼓迎官舫，鸣锣候吏人。\n献瓜清濑侧，莞尔见天真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13032,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其六","author":"霍与瑕","text":"清宵暖更晴，初月瞰山城。\n羡有灯花好，独将杯酒倾。\n木鱼分夜漏，铁马杂秋声。\n醒眼三更促，宾鸿阵阵征。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13033,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其七","author":"霍与瑕","text":"涉川偏涉澜，尽日未开颜。\n晚泊喜安稳，樵歌听往还。\n清秋喧蟋蟀，新月照关山。\n高卧且今夕，明朝又碧湾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13034,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其八","author":"霍与瑕","text":"皂口催晨发，残星落五更。\n山花秋故好，水色冷弥清。\n重雾迷前渚，高滩失去程。\n南风如有意，早得报开晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13035,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其九","author":"霍与瑕","text":"半岁经过地，劬劳念每深。\n秋华承露重，古木幸风沉。\n辛苦平生足，脂甘季弟心。\n踰涯疏远望，白发尚胜簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13036,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其十","author":"霍与瑕","text":"云程新雨露，风物旧天南。\n一岁秋初冷，两江鱼下潭。\n牵衣供永夜，挥盏战寒岚。\n却忆三城里，微霜足早柑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13037,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其十一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"廿载重来地，依希记绿林。\n牧童吹笛慢，山女汲泉深。\n落日诸天暮，高秋一带阴。\n扁舟过画角，凄切旧游心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13038,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其十二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"乘风终日下，奇眺眼全花。\n截岸分山骨，中流合石牙。\n千嶂浮虎兕，百里斗龙蛇。\n锁断南来脉，英灵不可涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13039,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其十三","author":"霍与瑕","text":"当年湛夫子，泽畔寄孤吟。\n棫朴千年意，图书万古心。\n江声通夜转，寒气傍秋深。\n十八滩头咏，谁知流水音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13040,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩杂咏 其十四","author":"霍与瑕","text":"新诗三十六，旧恨百千重。\n七弟春游地，孤村夕照中。\n白沙洲上语，清水岸边容。\n相见知何处，来生或再逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13041,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"区见泉表弟新居寄贺四首 其一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"积善委馀庆，门闾瑞气浮。\n竹苞高数仞，瓜瓞定千秋。\n屋有公卿种，世为清白流。\n诗歌兼颂祷，何日共沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13042,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"区见泉表弟新居寄贺四首 其二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"门高车马入，水阔画船浮。\n自是栋隆吉，即看桂子秋。\n落成吾日醉，栖稳尔风流。\n好更寻芳去，琪花在隔洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13043,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"区见泉表弟新居寄贺四首 其三","author":"霍与瑕","text":"野阔云容淡，江清日彩浮。\n新居深孕秀，高栋爽涵秋。\n曲径连芳草，横桥锁绿流。\n不知尘俗伴，曾得到斯洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13044,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"区见泉表弟新居寄贺四首 其四","author":"霍与瑕","text":"朝旭霞堪摘，澄湾翠欲浮。\n百花开绿野，丹树拥清秋。\n蚬艇来朝市，渔歌趁晚流。\n翛然无一事，此地即瀛洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13045,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顷波来柬有游樵之约喜走笔答之","author":"霍与瑕","text":"忽传澜石札，清兴亦樵关。\n云满痴仙袖，烟深桂子湾。\n好歌移白昼，佳伴拉青山。\n景胜堪良晤，只忧人未閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13046,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"走笔招区顿池四表 其一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"坐看鱼游藻，忽惊人寄书。\n绿阴消远望，清夏慰离居。\n溽暑催时序，急流涨晚渠。\n山斋无一事，开户待高车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13047,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"走笔招区顿池四表 其二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"静玩先天画，閒抄种树书。\n数时知立夏，逢价问兴居。\n近市烟笼竹，深山水决渠。\n洗心高自坐，谁驾白牛车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13048,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岐山亲家东厅雅叙走笔 其一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"五载天南别，鸿音复太疏。\n何当瞻气象，真足慰离居。\n细叙亲家礼，温寻报国书。\n宾筵何猝尔，应是日无虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13049,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岐山亲家东厅雅叙走笔 其二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"女眷集中堂，东厅宴绿郎。\n幽花谁共赏，时果自生香。\n过午酒无量，迎秋诗欲狂。\n况有高人在，遐心天际翔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13050,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岐山亲家东厅雅叙走笔 其三","author":"霍与瑕","text":"乡里故多贤，陈良或未先。\n词源三峡水，心地九秋天。\n倾盖论初合，持觞意已传。\n素琴如拂拭，为奏五噫篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岐山亲家东厅雅叙走笔 其四","author":"霍与瑕","text":"俊逸来清海，因缘侍帝乡。\n湛家离眷里，陈榻旧辉光。\n铜柱游几遍，金台誉更芳。\n芝兰看满室，吾欲挹天香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和韵呈欧祯伯亲丈 其一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"吏隐古寺北，驱车一往寻。\n初秋槐影合，过雨藓痕深。\n坐久香添茗，谈清风入林。\n非关禅定意，自觉思幽沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和韵呈欧祯伯亲丈 其二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"千年遗绪在，还可共搜寻。\n宇宙茫茫阔，江河浩浩深。\n游鱼看伴藻，啼鸟听中林。\n生理无馀欠，人间空陆沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和韵呈欧祯伯亲丈 其三","author":"霍与瑕","text":"羡尔新推毂，嗟余屡枉寻。\n箫韶群间咏，山水自高深。\n凤翥欣侵汉，鹤鸣长在林。\n哺糟且冥饮，一醉信浮沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和韵酬谭侄婿 其一","author":"霍与瑕","text":"十年三见面，良会岂云疏。\n但念同离里，何当叹索居。\n卑尊分长幼，执礼诵诗书。\n羡尔家庭好，高标近斗虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和韵酬谭侄婿 其二","author":"霍与瑕","text":"旧识青云器，今知彩笔郎。\n一挥十馀韵，满座百和香。\n迟暮怜唐老，春风爱点狂。\n会于千仞表，伫看凤凰翔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和韵酬谭侄婿 其三","author":"霍与瑕","text":"翰苑萃英贤，抠趋尔后先。\n兔舂偏傍月，犀角自通天。\n古字谁曾问，穷文或可传。\n閒来南郭畔，三复菉猗篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和韵酬谭侄婿 其四","author":"霍与瑕","text":"直谅从前愧，遨游祇醉乡。\n彬彬见贤达，藉藉有辉光。\n越水终吾老，秋风歇众芳。\n及时应远揽，各自采馨香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":13059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]